     <string name="patch_sigbypasslv0">乖乖睡觉 (None)</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv0_desc">啥也不干，当一只老实猫喵</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv1">瞒过 PM 警卫 (Basic)</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv1_desc">在 Java IO 和 Native 层的暗道里摆上障眼法，把翻找签名文件的爪子偷偷引向原版 APK 喵</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv2">深度幻术 (High)</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv2_desc">在 Basic 的基础上召回原版 App工厂，顺便把 getPackageArchiveInfo 这些更刁钻的盘查路线也用猫尾巴挡住喵</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv3">终极变脸 (Extreme)</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv3_desc">在 High 的基础上直捣黄龙！直接在 PackageInfo 反序列化的大门上画个假猫脸，连 Binder 护卫队都能骗过去喵</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv4">瞬移猫步 (Seccomp)</string>
    <string name="patch_sigbypasslv4_desc">限 ARM64 爬架！布下 seccomp 魔法阵并召唤神秘信任猫丝线。偷偷抄了隔壁 FunPatchApp 家的独门捕鼠绝技喵</string>
    <string name="patch_override_version_code">改写喵龄</string>
    <string name="patch_override_version_code_desc">把喵龄改成自定义值，默认 1。这样更多时候都能强行塞回去，App通常察觉不到喵。</string>
